  "releaseNotes": "*\tMerge pull request #50 from matthew25187/develop\n*\tEnhanced CI pipeline for improved flexibility and efficiency (#51)\n*\tRefactor pipeline configuration to remove redundant .NET installation tasks (#47)\n*\tRemoved redundant XML documentation comments from ISO 3166-2 subdivision files (#46)\n*\tAdd DOS Date/Time Support to Chronology Package (#49)\n*\tAdd Julian Day Number and Unix Time utilities with tests (#48)\n*\tEnhanced ISO 3166-2 Subdivision Code Generation Script (#45)\n*\tRefactored documentation for improved clarity and structure (#43)\n*\tAdded UseDotNet@2 task to CI pipeline for .NET Core SDK management (#44)\n*\tAdded support for .NET 10.0 across all projects and tests (#42)\n*\tUpdated project dependencies and test configurations (#41)\n*\tUpdated project files to disable source revision inclusion in informational version (#40)\n*\tAdded CSV File Support to DataStandardizer (#39)\n*\tUpdate read-csv-files.md (#38)\n*\tUpdated README with project documentation link (#37)\n*\tAdded comprehensive user guides for Data Standardizer packages (#36)\n*\tEnhanced CSV File Support in DataStandardizer.File (#35)\n*\tAdd new projects for language, geography, and language tag support (#34)\n*\tdocs: Add DataStandardizer.File package details to README (#33)",
